        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Diondra",
            text: _("Your feet are lead, woman of Rochelm. How can we pursue creatures of the water when you are bound to land? Have you no swift gryphons or sleek boats to carry you hence?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("Good mermaid, most of us are farmers, not fishers. Elyn took our best seaworthy boat, and— well, you know that story..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("But we’re almost upon the fishing village of Stuxton. Mayhaps they’ve had trouble with pirates too. Even if they aren’t willing to join us, I’m sure they’ll let us borrow of their fishing fleet."),
