          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("I can do that. The two boats still afloat are damaged and taking on water. We may have to split our forces if we want to claim both before they sink."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("This will be a quick expedition, but that doesn’t mean we should let down our guard. The forest echoes with the howls of wolves..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_19",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22leader2%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("What’s this? There’s a living man inside this wolf’s belly!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Red",
            text: _("By Haldric, I’m free!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Red",
            text: _("I was supposed to be delivering tea to my poor sick grandmother. “<i>My, what big teeth you have</i>”, I told her... and then my “grandmother” leapt out of bed and swallowed me whole!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Red",
            text: _("Tricked by a wolf, hrmph. I suppose I’ve nothing better to do now than to join you. Perhaps someday I’ll write a popular children’s fable about my harrowing experience..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_achievement",
            id: "pap_s03",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("The worst of the wolves are dealt with, but we must still reach the last boats before they sink."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_21",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_adjacent%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22skiff1%2Cskiff2%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$unit.id",
            text: _("I’m repairing the second skiff! There’s more bodies inside. It looks like a family tried to hide here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "skiff1,skiff2",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "set_variable",
                name: "this_item.side",
                value: 4,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:heal_unit",
            amount: "full",
            restore_statuses: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22skiff1%2Cskiff2%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_adjacent%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22%24unit.id%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
            id: "skiff1,skiff2",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "skiff1,skiff2",
            x: 30,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("Pa used to take me here for festivals, back when. I knew some of these dead... Was there anything we could have done?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("Forget it. Come on, everyone. Let’s get away from this dead place."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_20",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_adjacent%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22skiff1%2Cskiff2%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$unit.id",
            text: _("I’ve reached the first skiff! The damage doesn’t look bad. I think I can get it seaworthy again."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
